---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
	<main class="site-shell">
		<nav class="nav" aria-label="주요 메뉴">
			<a class="brand" href="/">Home</a>
			<div class="nav-links">
				<a href="/about">About</a>
				<a href="/projects">Projects</a>
				<a href="/posts">Posts</a>
			</div>
		</nav>

		<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="page-title">
			<p class="eyebrow">Astro personal website</p>
			<h1 id="page-title">안녕하세요. 제 생각과 작업을 정리하는 개인 홈페이지입니다.</h1>
			<p class="intro">
				작게 시작해서 꾸준히 확장하는 공간입니다. 오늘은 Home 페이지에서 출발하고,
				나중에 소개, 프로젝트, 글 목록을 자연스럽게 이어 붙일 수 있게 구성했습니다.
			</p>
			<div class="actions">
				<a class="primary" href="/projects">프로젝트 보기</a>
				<a class="secondary" href="/about">소개 보기</a>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="next-sections" aria-label="앞으로 추가할 섹션">
			<article>
				<span>01</span>
				<h2>About</h2>
				<p>내 소개와 관심사를 담을 페이지입니다.</p>
			</article>
			<article>
				<span>02</span>
				<h2>Projects</h2>
				<p>만든 것과 배우는 중인 것을 정리합니다.</p>
			</article>
			<article>
				<span>03</span>
				<h2>Posts</h2>
				<p>기록하고 싶은 생각과 글을 모읍니다.</p>
			</article>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	.site-shell {
		width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 40px));
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 28px 0 56px;
	}

	.nav {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 24px;
		min-height: 44px;
	}

	a {
		color: inherit;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	.brand {
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		font-weight: 800;
	}

	.nav-links {
		display: flex;
		gap: 20px;
		color: #4f5b52;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}

	.nav-links a:hover,
	.nav-links a:focus-visible {
		color: #17201b;
	}

	.hero {
		display: grid;
		align-content: center;
		min-height: 62vh;
		padding: 72px 0 48px;
	}

	.eyebrow {
		margin: 0 0 18px;
		color: #8b5d2d;
		font-size: 0.82rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
	}

	h1 {
		max-width: 860px;
		margin: 0;
		font-size: clamp(3rem, 9vw, 6.7rem);
		line-height: 0.98;
		letter-spacing: 0;
	}

	.intro {
		max-width: 660px;
		margin: 28px 0 0;
		color: #46544b;
		font-size: 1.15rem;
		line-height: 1.8;
	}

	.actions {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 12px;
		margin-top: 34px;
	}

	.primary,
	.secondary {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		min-height: 46px;
		padding: 0 18px;
		border: 1px solid #17201b;
		border-radius: 6px;
		font-weight: 800;
	}

	.primary {
		background: #17201b;
		color: #fffaf2;
	}

	.secondary {
		color: #17201b;
	}

	.next-sections {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: 1px;
		overflow: hidden;
		border: 1px solid rgba(23, 32, 27, 0.16);
		border-radius: 8px;
		background: rgba(23, 32, 27, 0.16);
	}

	.next-sections article {
		min-height: 170px;
		padding: 24px;
		background: rgba(255, 250, 242, 0.72);
	}

	.next-sections span {
		color: #8b5d2d;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		font-weight: 800;
	}

	.next-sections h2 {
		margin: 44px 0 8px;
		font-size: 1.4rem;
	}

	.next-sections p {
		margin: 0;
		color: #56635a;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		.site-shell {
			width: min(100% - 28px, 1120px);
			padding-top: 18px;
		}

		.nav {
			align-items: flex-start;
			flex-direction: column;
		}

		.nav-links {
			width: 100%;
			justify-content: space-between;
			gap: 10px;
		}

		.hero {
			min-height: auto;
			padding: 56px 0 38px;
		}

		h1 {
			font-size: 3rem;
		}

		.next-sections {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>
